1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Duedle for Safari — Moodle at Nagoya Institute of Technology

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Enable Duedle in Safari and allow access to the Moodle site.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Assignments and quizzes appear together on the dashboard.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Cards show deadlines, submission status and quiz information.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
Filter the list by task type and completion status.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Switch status filters to find the tasks you need.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Filter by deadline; status colors can also be customized.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Use the display filter to switch between visible and hidden tasks.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Scroll horizontally to browse more task cards.

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Quiz cards include a manual completion control.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Open a card menu to hide an individual task.

12
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Hidden tasks remain available through the display filter.

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Select multiple tasks and hide them together.

14
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Switch the display filter to review the remaining tasks.

15
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Open “Duedle settings” to change the appearance.

16
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Choose the soft-color theme or dark mode.

17
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Light mode and browser appearance sync are also available.

18
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,000
The iOS-style appearance is an independent setting.

19
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Open course ordering and visibility settings from the menu.

20
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Return to the dashboard to check the course overview.

21
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Course settings stay accessible from the Duedle menu.

22
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:44,000
Use this page to manage course order and visibility.

23
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:49,000
Return to the dashboard and open Duedle settings.

24
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:56,500
The built-in help page explains the task list and controls.

25
00:02:56,500 --> 00:03:02,500
Help includes illustrated instructions and demonstration videos.

26
00:03:02,500 --> 00:03:09,000
Installation instructions cover Safari on Mac, iPhone and iPad.

27
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,333
Return to Moodle to continue using Duedle.
